{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KmBhBWM9dlfj4V7YCsAVUg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:48.829186+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KmBhBWM9dlfj4V7YCsAVUg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KkKKVu2ThxoffH0fOADrh8fZj3ZSfy1RZZUUXhjNmtR4t5VIao9dK05cIbPc0RUNvxMzkGQcdn0Zoqu0iaQXwjViapauQelOBtpWOsMWUicmbY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>河海大学海洋学院2026年</span></p><p><span>全国优秀大学生校园开放日</span></p><p><span>及有关安排的通知</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KkKKVu2ThxqU6wfBVK1m4ahMyYJ67NQw2JALicjliczeNnLWMZibH9Gqokq6HOB0yefuEEiaiaAdOBGYAzujgplU3pB2SVbHQR43BrQEUUHb7UjY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KkKKVu2Thxpuic02M9mWSazicVEibwkcibmxjSkCxqEF9XgP5pQgsMedBAHwow6rboKffuxCadobobRjibArpXlIqnTuIR7OibqbOk0Bh91UaLJHA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>为让更多优秀考生更深入地了解我院特色与优势，各学科实力、师资力量、研究生教育情况和研究生招生信息等，我院将于2026年<span>9月中下旬</span>举办校园开放日活动。活动期间，我院将进行研究生招生政策宣讲、<span>前沿学术报告</span>、导师面对面交流互动等活动，提供详尽的报考信息和指导。欢迎有意向报考我院研究生的同学前来参加，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KkKKVu2ThxoZ9KVW0oibuAgzIkbxWOJgoBkfH8IZKgSl4U0j8ia0g1tR2ubG2rUHxN0R1NneLYWpDbJTXLYc10eaOfQpTFmnFn3eLPe1GTMdI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>一、活动规模及活动对象</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  PART 1  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次活动规模拟定50名左右，具体专业详见报名系统，报名条件如下：</span></p><p><span>1.具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2.高水平大学或设有特色专业全日制高校的本科三年级在校生（2027届毕业生）。</span></p><p><span>3.有意来河海大学求学深造，对所报专业有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事相关学术研究或实践工作。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KkKKVu2ThxodMib64x0QCPL9JXsTDDASPjxTRuWkDYH5iaAIbGq4Xp1iakcbcEvpAn8kL4gZ1RsiayMzlz8kHCia9CUXHWV9epRjZjMBTtHicwjI0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>二、活动规模及活动对象</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  PART 2  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>请有意向申请我院校园开放日的同学于北京时间<span>2026年8月1日8:00—2026年8月29日18:00</span>，在河海大学研究生招生管理系统（考生端）（https://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/）中，招生项目选择“全国优秀大学生校园开放日”进行注册、登录和信息填报（具体操作详见系统提示），不在规定时间内填报的所有报名信息均无效。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KkKKVu2ThxrwmTrAibCwgchMyWibjIfnnMvg2MxGgyoKNFibyLf0TPq2ticw1ucHbZY8iblqfJibWvKj0VzFrvtZX8cv2p4M4ecIseSRkmCUciaWRQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>三、材料提交与确认</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  PART 3  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.参加我院校园开放日的同学，需提供以下材料（请按照顺序扫描成PDF文件，汇总生成一个压缩包，命名方式：报名专业_报名姓名_校园开放日报名材料.ZIP，上传至报名系统）。</span></p><p><span>（1）“2026年全国优秀大学生校园开放日报名登记表”1份（请至报名系统生成和下载）。</span></p><p><span>（2）身份证、学生证复印件。</span></p><p><span>（3）前两年半成绩单与总评成绩、排名证明1份。</span></p><p><span>（4）学术或科研成果、各类获奖证书扫描件各1份。</span></p><p><span>（5）国家英语四、六级考试成绩，或IELTS/TOEFL成绩，或GRE/GMAT成绩等体现自身外语水平的证明材料1份。</span></p><p><span>2.我院将对提交的报名信息进行审核后确定入围开放日活动对象。<span>请提交报名申请的同学于北京时间8月30日前登录报名系统</span>查询审核状态，<span>入围者请于北京时间8月31日18时前</span>，在报名系统中点击确认参加，逾期未确认参加者视作放弃。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KkKKVu2ThxruNeUEXuhvDwXzn10EBn8DAG5UCSYybmFtsib6472kxaq9CLxQQly9BAOT2Y6RmRTdUGF9BibNCw8MslptVlJzsJAXXVsbOtaKg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>四、活动方式及具体安排</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  PART 4  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>我院开放日<span>时间拟定于9月中下旬</span>，采取<span>线下和线上（网络远程）相结合方式</span><span>开展活动</span>，原则上南京市高校学生需线下参加活动，外地高校学生可以申请线上参加，开放日期间活动安排如下：</span></p></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><strong><span>序号</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>内容</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>备注</span></strong></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>开放日报到，</span></p><p><span>提交报名材料</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>海洋学院907室</span></p><p><span><span>（加入QQ群：1046590877）</span></span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学院开幕式</span></p></section></section></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><section><section><p><span>待通知</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>院系、专业、导师介绍，校园文化特色介绍</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span><span>学科前沿</span>学术讲座</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>5</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>参观河海大学海洋学院</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>待通知</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>6</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>优秀导师、优秀在校研究生</span></p><p><span>面对面交流</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>待通知</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KkKKVu2ThxpTGoxPLBibH4icFh7JRpicgJZ3N0KZ3PWR6zZcHTViatbq0O1yOia1O6hLtLZrWmFcuicbMo0fMR4VtPKGm1bp2of4P5XPAfibob8vgs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>五、其他</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  PART 5  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.其他未尽事宜请参见单位官网通知，最终招生单位、专业、方向和导师以2027年博士、硕士研究生招生简章和专业目录公布信息为准。</span></p><p><span>2.开放日待遇：</span></p><p><span>（1）差旅、食宿：</span></p><p><span>学院提供校园开放日期间在南京的食宿（本校和南京本地学生住宿交通自理），并按相关政策补贴一定的交通费。</span></p><p><span>（2）保险：学院将为线下参加校园开放日的同学购买开放日间人身意外伤害保险。</span></p><p><span>3.联系方式：</span></p><p><span>联系人：刘老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：025-83772021</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：20230033@hhu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>通信地址：南京市江宁区佛城西路8号河海大学海洋学院907室</span></p><p><span>海洋学院</span></p><p><span>2026年7月31日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span>END</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑 | 方佳伟</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核 | 刘彩英、赖颖</span></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/xU6KSEt7swCBUzyuiat8fwIxku95Owlh5A18wuhzYYfxHXD23kLb4py91I3eY5Tkp7wbJFQMnzplDbjscRoYLWg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xU6KSEt7swCBUzyuiat8fwIxku95Owlh5n2M9PulSor9MGIHXjx5A3yM4cj7yeYsD4SjndicXKzyYDZoYP7lJfibg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI5MzQ4MjA3OA==&amp;mid=2247547248&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=a1e97fb23f6ef6ce0430c7d66784e866&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>“职” 点迷津 —— 海洋研究生求职秘籍 | 第五期</span></a></span></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI5MzQ4MjA3OA==&amp;mid=2247547187&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=84339a232fdb3539469935a31e1c1f64&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>青春三下乡 | 我院“长江渔生发展调研团”赴两村开展长江发展成就观察主题调研</span></a></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e1dcab615053f7cc16415c9a9d5bee9742e006fc71131b1ab34b1ce9c202a186","textLength":1464,"sourceSha256":"5d4cce0a9b3a06aee03b0905c50b2a96f373116d19d543a6251ad84dccb51dde","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-018fad702b7d7fc8de68","title":"2026年河海大学海洋学院2026年全国优秀大学生校园开放日及有关安排的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:48.829186+00:00"}
